  "prompt": "[Figure 1]\n\nA drone was launched upward from a platform. The graph shown models the height above ground,\n[Figure 2]\n, in meters, of the drone\n[Figure 3]\nseconds after it was launched. For which of the following intervals of time was the height of the drone increasing for the entire interval?",
