    "D": "From\n[Figure 10]\nto\n[Figure 11]"
  },
  "correctAnswer": "A",
  "explanation": "Choice A is correct. The variable $y$ represents the height, in meters, of the drone above the ground. The graph shows that the height of the drone was increasing from $x = 0$ to $x = 3$, and decreasing from $x = 3$ onward. Therefore, the height of the drone was increasing for the entire interval of time from $x = 0$ to $x = 3$.\n\nWhy D is incorrect:\n\nChoice D is incorrect. The height of the drone was decreasing, not increasing, for this entire interval of time.",
